flowchart TD
  A[Incoming Request] --> B{Request Type}
  B -->|New Goal| C[Run Planning Pipeline]
  B -->|Feedback Event| D[Run Revision Pipeline]
  B -->|Evaluation Only| E[Run Feasibility Checks]

  C --> C1[Decompose Goal]
  C1 --> C2[Retrieve Topics and Materials]
  C2 --> C3[Estimate Effort]
  C3 --> C4[Solve Schedule with Constraints]
  C4 --> C5[Score Feasibility and Quality]
  C5 --> C6{Score Above Threshold}
  C6 -->|Yes| C7[Publish Plan]
  C6 -->|No| C8[Auto-Replan with Relaxed Soft Constraints]
  C8 --> C5

  D --> D1[Classify Feedback]
  D1 --> D2[Impact Analysis]
  D2 --> D3{Local or Global Impact}
  D3 -->|Local| D4[Revise Affected Units Only]
  D3 -->|Global| D5[Partial Re-Optimization of Remaining Plan]
  D4 --> D6[Evaluate Revised Plan]
  D5 --> D6
  D6 --> D7[Publish Revision with Diff]

  E --> E1[Dependency Validation]
  E1 --> E2[Workload Balance Check]
  E2 --> E3[Coverage Check]
  E3 --> E4[Risk and Feasibility Report]

  C7 --> Z[Persist Versioned Context]
  D7 --> Z
  E4 --> Z
